data: {"id": "6fe88439f4794f2f-thinking-parallel_evidence-937", "run_id": "6fe88439f4794f2f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据采集到的事实，分析如下：\n\n**实体身份确认**\n- Pod: `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr`\n- Namespace: `aiops-case-08`\n- UID: `cfa13c1e-da2a-4e37-8baa-ec4be4c24c35` (一致)\n\n**事实支持**\n1.  **确认为 CrashLoopBackOff**:\n    - `kubectl_get_by_name` 显示 STATUS 为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，RESTARTS 为 13。\n    - `kubectl_describe` 显示最近 Reason: `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n    - `kubectl_get_yaml` 显示 `containers with unready status: [app]`。\n    - **结论**: 当前异常状态为 **CrashLoopBackOff** (与初始状态一致，未恢复)。\n\n2.  **Crash 的直接原因为 OOMKilled**:\n    - `kubectl_describe` 明", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788801779813, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

