data: {"id": "6fe88439f4794f2f-final", "run_id": "6fe88439f4794f2f", "seq": 942, "ts_ms": 1788801796371, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr (aiops-case-08) 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态，持续约 53 分钟，重启 13 次。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: OOMKilled; `container.last_exit_code`: 137 | 确认最近一次崩溃的直接机制是内存耗尽被系统终止 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: CrashLoopBackOff; `restart_count`: 13 | 确认因反复崩溃导致的周期性重启状态 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_limit.memory`: 64Mi | 确认容器内存硬限制，OOMKilled 触发的阈值上限 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | `allocated_mib`: first=14 → last=48 (pattern: memory allocation advanced) | 日志显示应用每次处理请求时内存使用量显著增加，证实内存线性增长趋势 |\n| 5 | Tracing | deepflow | HTTP Flow `GET /work` `response_code`: 200; `span` `aiops.observed_mode`: oom_growth | 追踪显示针对 `/work` 的请求成功返回但伴随内存持续增长模式，关联日志确认泄漏源头 |\n\n上述证据形成闭环：追踪和日志确认 `/work` 接口存在内存持续增长现象（E4），最终内存占用突破 64Mi 限制导致进程被 OOMKilled（E1, E3），进而触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启循环（E2）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用代码在 /work 端点存在内存泄漏 (日志与追踪确认) → 每次请求内存线性增长 (Logging/Tracing) → 容器内存占用超过 64Mi 硬限制触发 OOMKilled (K8s State) → Pod 进程退出进入 CrashLoopBackOff (K8s State)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为应用程序代码存在内存泄漏。证据表明，应用在处理 `/work` 请求时内存使用量随请求持续线性增长（E4, E5），最终突破了配置的 `64Mi` 内存硬限制，导致 OOMKilled 机制介入终止进程（E1, E3）。频繁的终止和重启导致了当前的 CrashLoopBackOff 状态（E2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 68.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr: 68.5s (Evidence 59.9s, RCA 8.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.758, "metrics": {"run_id": "6fe88439f4794f2f", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.76005554199219, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 95760.05554199219, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 61959.73062515259, "tool_calls": 17, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 58035.98070144653, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 33251.70111656189}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19368.085145950317, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 68462.08906173706, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 